						const body = "\n# Dana Dragomirescu\n\nDana Dragomirescu is a trainer and counselor in relationships and communication through the ESPERE® Method, a classical psychodrama director and trainer-in-training.\n\n## Background\n\nAs a woman, wife, mother, and creator, Dana facilitates workshops and personal development programs. Her mission is to bring practices that support the being as a whole through sensory reconnection, body awareness, and the integration of healthy emotional and relational ecology.\n\n## Approach\n\nThrough the ESPERE® Method and psychodrama techniques, Dana helps individuals and groups develop healthier communication patterns and emotional awareness.\n\n## Connect\n\n- **Website**: [dana.earth](https://dana.earth)\n- **Substack**: [Dana Dragomirescu](https://danadragomirescu.substack.com)\n";
